INSERT INTO `chunk` VALUES ('003d0246-2cf3-4e4e-bd2d-31df0356e81e','6bacab7c-42f7-4557-8867-c97006b1619d','3.  分解任务 (Tasks)： 编程 Agent 根据规范和计划将其拆解为实际工作——即细小、可评审的模块，每个模块解决一个特定的难题。每个任务都应该是可以独立实现并测试的，这几乎就像是为你 AI Agent 准备的测试驱动开发。得到的不再是“构建身份验证”这种模糊指令，而是“创建一个验证电子邮件格式的用户注册接口”这样具体的任务。\n\n4.  实施 (Implement)： 你的编程 Agent 逐一（或并行）处理任务。你无需再去评审数千行的代码堆，而是评审针对特定问题的专项更改。Agent 清楚构建什么（规范）、如何构建（计划）以及目前该做什么（任务）。关键在于，你的角色是分阶段验证：规范是否领会了你的意图？计划是否考虑了约束？AI 是否遗漏了边缘情况？该流程内置了多个检查点，让你在推进之前能够进行评价、寻找漏洞并校正方向。\n\n这种闸口式的工作流防止了 Willison 所说的“纸牌屋代码”——即那些经不起推敲、脆弱的 AI 输出。Anthropic 的 Skills 系统也提供了类似的模式，允许你定义基于 Markdown 的可重用行为供 Agent 调用。通过将规范嵌入这些工作流，可以确保在规范通过验证之前 Agent 无法推进，且任何变更都会自动同步到任务分解和测试中。',9,422,'{\"charEnd\": 5838, \"docType\": \"webpage\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 5289, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\", \"sourcePath\": null, \"headingPath\": [\"拆解GitHub 2500个案例后：我们总结出编写AI Agent规范的“六大军规”\", \"1. 从顶层愿景开始，让 AI 拟定细节\", \"2. 像写专业的 PRD（或 SRS）一样构建规范\", \"3. 将任务拆解为模块化的提示词和上下文，而非单一庞大的提示词\", \"单 Agent vs 多 Agent：何时该用哪种\", \"4. 内置自检、约束和人类的专业经验\", \"5. 测试、迭代并演进规范（并使用正确的工具）\", \"避免常见坑点\", \"结语\"], \"documentTitle\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\"}','ffe430b44ffdc7d02b5826696b52754095c1b41221dcca59d28bf1db62d8dd92','2026-08-21 07:19:36.950'),('01ad6036-3d55-4de8-98b1-814bc20d1c1e','595cccd5-b821-406a-8741-303737d020e4','24 of 30  Table A5.   Representative datasets and benchmarks for agent context management.  Benchmark   Source & year   Open Source  SWE-bench Verified [61]   ICLR 2024   https://huggingface.co/datasets/SWE-bench/ SWE-bench_Verified GAIA [91]   arXiv 2023   https://huggingface.co/datasets/gaia- benchmark/GAIA BrowseComp [62]   arXiv 2025   https://github.com/openai/simple-evals BrowseComp-Plus [63]   ACL 2026   https://huggingface.co/datasets/Tevatron/ browsecomp-plus BrowseComp-ZH [64]   arXiv 2025   https://huggingface.co/datasets/PALIN2018/ BrowseComp-ZH Mind2Web [65]   NeurIPS 2023   https: //huggingface.co/datasets/osunlp/Mind2Web Multimodal-Mind2Web [66]   ICML 2024   https://huggingface.co/datasets/osunlp/ Multimodal-Mind2Web HLE [92]   arXiv 2025   https://huggingface.co/datasets/cais/hle AppWorld [93]   ACL 2024   https://github.com/StonyBrookNLP/appworld OfficeBench [94]   arXiv 2024   https://github.com/zlwang-cs/OfficeBench HotpotQA [95]   EMNLP 2018   https://hotpotqa.github.io/ Natural Questions [96]   TACL 2019   https://github.com/google-research-datasets/ natural-questions TriviaQA [97]   ACL 2017   http://nlp.cs.washington.edu/triviaqa/ GSM8K [98]   arXiv 2021   https://github.com/openai/grade-school-math MATH / MATH-500 [99]   NeurIPS 2021   https://github.com/hendrycks/math SWE-bench Lite [61]   ICLR 2024   https://huggingface.co/datasets/princeton-nlp/ SWE-bench_Lite ALFWorld [100]   ICLR 2021   https://github.com/alfworld/alfworld WebShop [101]   NeurIPS 2022   https://github.com/princeton-nlp/webshop AndroidWorld / AW-Extend [102]   ICLR 2025   https: //github.com/google-research/android_world DeepResearch Bench [103]   arXiv 2025   https://github.com/Ayanami0730/deep_ research_bench TerminalBench (TB 1.0 / 2.0) [104]   arXiv 2026   https://github.com/harbor-framework/ terminal-bench MRQA [71]   EMNLP WS 2019   https://huggingface.co/datasets/mrqa CodeXGLUE [105]   NeurIPS / FSE 2021   https://github.com/microsoft/CodeXGLUE AIOpsLab [106]   MLSys 2025   https://microsoft.github.io/AIOpsLab/ Loghub [72]   ISSRE 2023   https://github.com/logpai/loghub LongBench [2]   MLSys 2024   https://huggingface.co/datasets/THUDM/ LongBench LongBench V2 [67]   ACL 2025   https://longbench2.github.io BABILong [68]   NeurIPS 2024   https://github.com/booydar/babilong ADRS Benchmark [107]   arXiv 2025   https://github.com/UCB-ADRS/ADRS WorkArena [108]   ICML 2024   https://github.com/ServiceNow/WorkArena MiniWoB [109]   ICML 2017   https://miniwob.farama.org/ MiniWoB++ [110]   ICLR 2018   https://miniwob.farama.org/ NeedleBench [69]   arXiv 2024   https: //github.com/open-compass/opencompass NIAH [70]   arXiv 2023   https: //github.com/open-compass/opencompass HaluMem [111]   arXiv 2025   https://huggingface.co/datasets/IAAR- Shanghai/HaluMem LongMemEval [112]   ICLR 2025   https://huggingface.co/datasets/xiaowu0162/ longmemeval-cleaned LoCoEval Framework [113]   arXiv 2026   - DevEval [114]   ACL Findings 2024   https://github.com/seketeam/DevEval Continued on next page  Preprints.org   (www.preprints.org) | NOT PEER-REVIEWED | Posted: 29 May 2026   doi:10.20944/preprints202605.2065.v1  © 2026 by the author(s). Distributed under a Creative Commons CC BY license.',24,807,'{\"charEnd\": 85043, \"docType\": \"pdf\", \"pageEnd\": 25, \"charStart\": 81817, \"pageStart\": 25, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\我\\\\论文\\\\Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\", \"headingPath\": [], \"documentTitle\": \"Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\"}','2a734fd6f6b46ecdb82e9d8918c34e2b32818fdad590045ea5e806825cdf8d79','2026-08-21 07:20:47.275'),('03b33f5d-916a-42fd-9097-921bb82c6635','595cccd5-b821-406a-8741-303737d020e4','9 of 30  sensitive to reward misspecification. Representative examples include ACON [38], MEM1 [40], and related policy-learning approaches.  5. Failure Modes  We organize context compression failures by the earliest stage at which they arise:   F1 :   Pre- compression Decision Error ,   F2 :   In-compression Information Loss , and   F3 :   Post-compression Access Failure , as shown in Figure 3. Context  Correct decision  Wrong decision  Decision point  1   2   3 F1 Pre-compression Decision Error  Wrong decision before compression  time  ...   ...  Summary cut  Before   After Too early summary  Information completeness Future evidence truncated  Dropped hard constraint  Date Month  Year  Date Month  Year  Constraint signal Critical constraint lost  Before   After Wrong goal retained Before   After  Correct goal   Wrong goal  Goal relevance  Focus shifted  F2 In-compression Information Loss  Compression damages the representation  Original Content   Compression  Distorted Representation  Before Lost file path After  project   >   src  config   > >  user.yaml  config src   >   >   …  Specificity Fine-grained paths lost  Merged two conditions  Before After  Condition distinction  Two cases collapsed Before After  No   Maybe   Yes  No   Maybe   Yes  Overconfident  Confidence  F3 Post-compression Access Failure  Retained information cannot be recovered or used  Stored Memory  Retrieval / Expansion Failure   Unusable Output  Before After  Maybe -> Yes  Query  >  Wrong chunk returned  Relevant content not recovered  Failed retrieval   Wrong reconstruction   Stored, not usable  Before After  A   B   C   D  A   B   C   D  Slots Recover  A   B   C   D  A   C   B   D  Slots Recover  Recovered content shifted Before After  Stored note   Task fields  Field 1:_ Field 2:_ Field 3:_  Stored but Operationally useless  Field 1: missing Field 2: vague Field 3: empty  Context Arrives  1  Thought-Action  2   3  Compression   Storage   Retrieval   Use in task  Figure 3.   A temporal taxonomy of context compression failures. Failures are classified by the earliest point at which they occur in the compression pipeline.  Preprints.org   (www.preprints.org) | NOT PEER-REVIEWED | Posted: 29 May 2026   doi:10.20944/preprints202605.2065.v1  © 2026 by the author(s). Distributed under a Creative Commons CC BY license.',9,582,'{\"charEnd\": 32381, \"docType\": \"pdf\", \"pageEnd\": 10, \"charStart\": 30053, \"pageStart\": 10, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\我\\\\论文\\\\Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\", \"headingPath\": [], \"documentTitle\": \"Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\"}','76a795827f70dd9af55e1e5d529c660fed08b75f0e32364e42c83c54278d9c47','2026-08-21 07:20:47.265'),('03df014d-0ebd-4fd5-8b88-49e7f91a6695','a974976b-7a08-4584-b427-02301a9ffcd2','## 4. Core Model',4,4,'{\"charEnd\": 1021, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 1005, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','51ffe28f515b323f4916690573737a74798c573870f5e48554942711951e1939','2026-08-21 07:17:59.382'),('045f0893-b343-4f53-9cc4-f5f677a34603','9f8623d6-6088-47b9-8fd5-da676edab435','## 1 场景描述\n\n智慧校园系统面向中小规模高校的日常管理需求，服务对象包括学生、教师和行政管理人员。系统整合校园内分散的业务数据，包括学生学籍信息、课程成绩、图书借阅、一卡通消费、门禁通行等数据来源。\n\n据调查，校园一卡通系统平均每校日均交易量超5000笔，包括食堂、超市、咖啡/奶茶店等多个消费场景。教务系统存储超万名学生的学籍和成绩数据，选课期间需要处理集中访问请求。门禁系统覆盖教学楼和宿舍楼等所有出入口，采用刷卡认证方式，日均产生通行记录数万条。\n\n系统建设目标是构建统一的数据平台，支撑校园管理决策分析和学生行为画像等应用。系统需要具备实时数据接入能力以支持消费和门禁数据的即时查询，同时需要批处理能力以完成学生综合分析等统计任务。',1,294,'{\"charEnd\": 341, \"docType\": \"docx\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 18, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"E:\\\\智慧校园.docx\", \"headingPath\": [\"智慧校园大数据系统设计说明书\", \"1  场景描述\", \"2  硬件架构及配置清单\", \"3  基础软件架构及各自作用\", \"4  待开发软件的程序级描述\", \"5  核心数据定义和生命周期管理\", \"6  核心业务流程\", \"7  拟开发平台、开源软件\"], \"documentTitle\": \"智慧校园.docx\"}','7dbeae3d615d3ce41f0a0415aa0bd9ec5d9d06bbe5920ff1b68b4be4ec16b8ac','2026-08-21 07:20:57.156'),('071edf0d-1b48-4e7d-8994-492649f12d8f','bf3a9adf-2c5e-47c4-82a0-160f5337c5f0','## 6. 关键用户流程',13,8,'{\"charEnd\": 2443, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 2431, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','9aeb8affcaeb5fb1688f427daae58c5f372931fa335408ff71b3a366ffa4099a','2026-08-21 07:14:21.069'),('08b288ad-88fe-414e-a1f1-9cd03ef97b5a','a974976b-7a08-4584-b427-02301a9ffcd2','### 行动线：准备做什么\n\n- **项目**：有明确起止时间和成果的行动容器，可挂目标，也可独立存在。\n- **待办**：单次行动，最多关联一个目标和一个生活项目。\n- **习惯**：独立实体，拥有打卡历史和连续天数，不与待办合并。',6,89,'{\"charEnd\": 1285, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 1168, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','5f6ba7e80b4fe1b523c7c8360066b167918fd59dfc9a00badc8d5a11128426f9','2026-08-21 07:17:59.386'),('09a50182-95b3-4789-8096-1d531aed27cf','212387c6-05f7-4c19-a401-8de1d2550973','该脚本会删除并重建   bookstore   数据库，同时创建表、索引和演示数据。已有同名数据库中的数据会被 清空，导入前请确认没有需要保留的数据。 推荐使用   Navicat   查询窗口导入：  1.   双击本地   MySQL   连接。  2.   点击   查询   ->   新建查询。  3.   用文本编辑器打开   database-design.sql 。  4.   复制   SQL   文件全部内容，粘贴到查询窗口。  5.   点击运行或按   F5   执行。  6.   执行完成后刷新连接，展开   bookstore ->   表。 也可以直接在   Navicat   中打开   SQL   文件，按   Ctrl + A   全选后点击运行。若中文路径导致异常，可将   SQL  文件复制到   D:\\bookstore\\database-design.sql 。  6.3   验证数据库导入  能看到   admin 、 reader1 ，并且表和书籍数据存在，说明导入成功。  七、配置项目数据库连接  配置文件： 默认配置： 如果   root   密码是   123456 ，不需要修改配置。如果密码不同，打开   IDEA   的   Run -> Edit Configurations ，选择   BookstoreApplication ，在   Environment variables   中填写： 如果数据库端口不同，也要设置完整的   BOOKSTORE_DB_URL 。这里的分号用于分隔   IDEA   的多个环境 变量，数据库   URL   中的参数分隔符仍使用   & 。  USE   bookstore; SHOW   TABLES; SELECT   username,   role   FROM   user_account; SELECT   COUNT(*)   AS   book_count   FROM   book; SELECT   COUNT(*)   AS   customer_count   FROM   customer; src/main/resources/application.properties spring.datasource.url=${BOOKSTORE_DB_URL:jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/bookstore? useUnicode=true&characterEncoding=utf8&serverTimezone=Asia/Shanghai} spring.datasource.username=${BOOKSTORE_DB_USER:root} spring.datasource.password=${BOOKSTORE_DB_PASSWORD:123456} spring.datasource.driver-class-name=com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver server.port=8080 BOOKSTORE_DB_USER=root;BOOKSTORE_DB_PASSWORD= 你的 MySQL 密码',4,548,'{\"charEnd\": 5540, \"docType\": \"pdf\", \"pageEnd\": 5, \"charStart\": 4178, \"pageStart\": 5, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\[数据库设计]小型网上书店系统\\\\部署教程.pdf\", \"headingPath\": [], \"documentTitle\": \"部署教程.pdf\"}','a903fd0fe903e9f13f979f75a0c8fae21264c2a1c64457354014c0e437530d36','2026-08-21 07:20:16.427'),('0a5f10b5-6241-4e3e-a088-65dc5128b2e1','595cccd5-b821-406a-8741-303737d020e4','11 of 30  Together,   F1 – F3   define a temporal failure taxonomy over the compression pipeline. For hybrid cases, we assign the label to the earliest failure that causally triggers later errors, since agent workflows naturally exhibit error propagation [59].  6. Domain-Specific Analysis  Compression is domain-dependent: coding agents require structural fidelity and state continuity; web and GUI agents must preserve heterogeneous multimodal observations; DeepResearch agents depend on deferred evidence recovery across long horizons. Figure 5 summarizes these regimes. Coding Agents 1  Web & GUI Agents 2  3   Research & Deep-Search Agents  Task  Fix repository code issues and verify them with tests  Task  Automate web/UI tasks and produce observable results  Task  Conduct deep research and produce high-quality conclusions with evidence  Select Task 1   Load Context 2  1  Identify a code issue   Read code and dependency context  Understand and Locate  3  Analyze where the issue is  Edit Code 4  Modify the code  Run Tests 5  Generate and run test cases  Debug & Fix 6   Verify 7  Diagnose and fix the issue   Pass tests  Output   Value  Runnable code Changes (test verified)  Faster delivery Higher-quality code  SWE-Pruner (Structured Retrieval + Pruning)  Set Goal 1  Define the target outcome  Perceive Page 2  Understand page context and structure  Parse Structure 3  Extract DOM / Key insights  Plan Actions 4  Plan execution steps  Take Actions 5  Click / type / scroll, etc.  Iterate 7 Observe Results  6  Capture execution feedback  Adjust strategy and continue  Output   Value  Task completed (target state achieved)  Automated execution Lower time cost  LoCoW (Compressed Context)  Ask Question 1  ?  Define the research question  Retrieve Information  2  Search relevant sources  Read and Understand  3  Read and understand content  Extract Evidence  4  Extract key evidence  Summarize Points  5  Extract key evidence  Store Citations  6  Record sources and citations  Verify 7  Check information reliability  Synthesize Conclusion  8  Conclude and Recommendations  COMPASS (Iterative Synthesis + Planning) ReSum (Rolling Summary)  Output   Value  Research report (with evidence and citations)  Deeper insights Reliable and traceable  AgentDiet (Context Folding)  Figure 5.   Domain-specific context compression regimes, contrasting setup, workflow, interaction loop, dominant risks, and strategy choices.  Coding Agents   Coding places the strongest pressure on structure preservation, exact evidence reten- tion, and reliable recovery. Accordingly, methods such as SWE-Pruner [46], LongCodeZip [60], and CAT [49] emphasize structure-aware pruning and explicit state retention. Table 2 compares recent production-grade coding agents through the unified operational pipeline, using only public evidence and high-confidence product signals. The contrast is instructive. Claude Code emphasizes   Compress  through reactive compaction, Cursor places more weight on   Store   and   Recover   through repository indexing and retrieval, and Codex appears most grounded in   Select   plus workspace continuation. Across all three, the common pattern is not aggressive lossy shortening, but coordinated pipeline control under tight context budgets.  Table 2.   Pipeline-level comparison of recent production-grade coding agents, organized by the stages in Section 2.2.  System   Select ( S )   Compress ( Φ )   Store ( M )   Recover ( R ) Claude Code  Reactive, threshold-based selection. Auto-compaction of prior interaction history. Compacted state retained in active context. Implicit recovery via continued execution.  Cursor  Retrieval-first selection of files, code blocks, and rules. Relevance filtering and contextual assembly. Repository index, project rules, and workspace context. Re-injection of retrieved files, rules, and evidence.  OpenAI Codex  Task-grounded selection over files, instructions, and threads. Session continuation and workspace grounding. Task threads, instruction files, and repository state. Recovery through continued threads and file re-access.  Web & GUI Agents   Web and GUI agents operate over heterogeneous, partially redundant observations. Methods such as LCoW [44] and PAL-UI [51] exploit redundancy, but representation-level compression must still preserve modality and interface cues.  Preprints.org   (www.preprints.org) | NOT PEER-REVIEWED | Posted: 29 May 2026   doi:10.20944/preprints202605.2065.v1  © 2026 by the author(s). Distributed under a Creative Commons CC BY license.',11,1135,'{\"charEnd\": 43311, \"docType\": \"pdf\", \"pageEnd\": 12, \"charStart\": 38772, \"pageStart\": 12, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\我\\\\论文\\\\Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\", \"headingPath\": [], \"documentTitle\": \"Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\"}','2fa34ce274d51453b1816063294d2f4e3ffd2fb873f2f8f41f3740dba185f963','2026-08-21 07:20:47.266'),('0e5f1e8d-f3c0-496d-8c75-c6f835b1a5b0','6bacab7c-42f7-4557-8867-c97006b1619d','###  5. 测试、迭代并演进规范（并使用正确的工具）\n\n**将编写规范和构建 Agent 视为一个迭代循环：尽早测试、收集反馈、完善规范，并利用工具自动化检查。**\n\n初始规范并不是终点，而是循环的起点。最好的结果来自于你持续对照规范验证 Agent 的工作并做出相应调整。此外，现代 AI 开发者会使用（从 CI 流水线到上下文管理工具的）各种工具来支持这一流程。\n\n![](https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260308/v2_536a89f7fa484fdaaca440ce710b1a43@1694_oswg103133oswg1535oswg688_img_jpg?x-oss-process=image/quality,q_100/format,jpg/interlace,1)\n\n持续测试：不要等到最后才看 Agent 是否符合规范。在每个重大里程碑甚至每个函数完成后，运行测试或至少进行快速的人工检查。如果失败了，在继续前先更新规范或提示词。比方说，如果规范说“密码必须用 bcrypt 加密”，而你看到 Agent 的代码在存储明文——停下来纠正它（并在规范或提示词中重申该规则）。自动化测试在这里大放异彩：如果你提供了测试（或随做随写），让 Agent 运行它们。在许多编程 Agent 设置中，你可以让 Agent 在完成任务后运行 \\`npm test\\` 或类似命令。结果（失败项）可以反馈到下一个提示词中，相当于告诉 Agent：“你的输出在 X、Y、Z 方面不符合规范——修复它。”这种“Agent 循环”（编写->测试->修复->重复）极具威力，也是 Claude Code 或 Copilot Labs 等工具能够处理更大型任务的原因。始终明确“完成”的定义（通过测试或标准）并进行检查。',24,492,'{\"charEnd\": 14850, \"docType\": \"webpage\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 14070, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\", \"sourcePath\": null, \"headingPath\": [\"拆解GitHub 2500个案例后：我们总结出编写AI Agent规范的“六大军规”\", \"1. 从顶层愿景开始，让 AI 拟定细节\", \"2. 像写专业的 PRD（或 SRS）一样构建规范\", \"3. 将任务拆解为模块化的提示词和上下文，而非单一庞大的提示词\", \"单 Agent vs 多 Agent：何时该用哪种\", \"4. 内置自检、约束和人类的专业经验\", \"5. 测试、迭代并演进规范（并使用正确的工具）\", \"避免常见坑点\", \"结语\"], \"documentTitle\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\"}','0e86afa5066b182870f5e201f9f2594727eb9a6170020003c64928b492c243dd','2026-08-21 07:19:36.959'),('12884e0e-75fc-4402-8ba5-a3fad987f931','a974976b-7a08-4584-b427-02301a9ffcd2','### P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\n\n| 功能 | 范围 |\n|---|---|\n| 开发项目 | 想法收集、价值/可行性评估、一键立项 |\n| 开发看板 | 自定义状态流、拖动切换、阶段进度 |\n| 洞察页 | 目标趋势、逾期模式、复盘摘要 |\n| 日检视/月度回顾/季度规划 | 周期性回顾流程 |\n| 日历与时间预算 | 待办日期、时间块、时长预算 |',12,128,'{\"charEnd\": 2429, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 2239, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','9111400767dff13bf0dcecf3f83fc9e4a94da064d36edfd53cb3ab6dbf634caf','2026-08-21 07:17:59.394'),('12955ab8-c6d1-4b52-ab1f-823c303a1ef6','595cccd5-b821-406a-8741-303737d020e4','22 of 30 27   Context-Folding   [84]   Agent-Controlled   Trajectory   Summarization & Abstraction  28   ContextWeaver   [19]   External Controller   Memory State   Pruning & Reduction  29   HIAGENT   [85]   Agent-Controlled   Plan & Reasoning   Summarization & Abstraction  30   ProMem   [54]   Agent-Controlled   Memory State   Summarization & Abstraction  31   OCR-Memory   [57]   External Controller   Memory State   Externalization & Retrieval  32   AgentDiet   [16]   System-Controlled   Trajectory   Pruning & Reduction  33   AgentProg   [86]   System-Controlled   Memory State   Pruning & Reduction  34   GCC   [20]   Agent-Controlled   Memory State   Externalization & Retrieval  35   TACO   [87]   Learned   Observation   Pruning & Reduction  36   CodeOCR   [88]   System-Controlled   Observation   Representation- Level  37   AttentionRAG   [89]   System-Controlled   Observation   Pruning & Reduction  38   LongCodeZip   [60]   System-Controlled   Observation   Pruning & Reduction  39   ReSum   [17]   System-Controlled   Trajectory   Summarization & Abstraction  40   Focus   [39]   Agent-Controlled   Trajectory   Pruning & Reduction  41   AgentFold   [18]   Agent-Controlled   Trajectory   Summarization & Abstraction  42   CAT   [49]   Agent-Controlled   Trajectory   Summarization & Abstraction  43   MEM1   [40]   Learned   Memory State   Summarization & Abstraction  44   ContextEvolve   [90]   External Controller   Memory State   Summarization & Abstraction  Table A4.   Open-source methods included in this survey.  Method   Open-source link   Year  SWE-Pruner [46]   https://github.com/Ayanami1314/swe-pruner   2026 Step-DeepResearch [48]   https://github.com/stepfun-ai/StepDeepResearch   2025 MCP-Bench [43]   https://github.com/Accenture/mcp-bench   2025 WebWeaver [50]   https://github.com/Alibaba-NLP/DeepResearch   2025 The Complexity Trap [15]   https://github.com/JetBrains-Research/the-complexity-trap   2025 WebClipper [47]   https://github.com/AQ-MedAI/AntAFu-DeepResearch   2026 ACON [38]   https://github.com/microsoft/acon   2025 SAC [42]   https://github.com/lx-Meteors/SAC   2026 SWE-AGILE [81]   https://github.com/KDEGroup/SWE-AGILE   2026 HIAGENT [85]   https://github.com/HiAgent2024/HiAgent   2025 AgentProg [86]   https://github.com/MobileLLM/AgentProg   2026 TACO [87]   https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/TACO   2026 CodeOCR [88]   https://github.com/YerbaPage/CodeOCR   2026 LongCodeZip [60]   https://github.com/YerbaPage/LongCodeZip   2025 ReSum [17]   https://github.com/Alibaba-NLP/DeepResearch   2026 AgentFold [18]   https://github.com/Alibaba-NLP/DeepResearch   2025 MEM1 [40]   https://github.com/MIT-MI/MEM1   2025 ContextEvolve [90]   https://anonymous.4open.science/r/ContextEvolve-ACC   2026  Preprints.org   (www.preprints.org) | NOT PEER-REVIEWED | Posted: 29 May 2026   doi:10.20944/preprints202605.2065.v1  © 2026 by the author(s). Distributed under a Creative Commons CC BY license.',22,740,'{\"charEnd\": 80122, \"docType\": \"pdf\", \"pageEnd\": 23, \"charStart\": 77164, \"pageStart\": 23, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\我\\\\论文\\\\Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\", \"headingPath\": [], \"documentTitle\": \"Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\"}','a07b4dc422ed71e4c598158b16989603b405899242abad9541e9d04fcb1bea74','2026-08-21 07:20:47.273'),('171e00b0-8e89-49f6-a570-6fa016d6333d','a974976b-7a08-4584-b427-02301a9ffcd2','## 8. 主要风险\n\n| 风险 | 等级 | 缓解措施 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 范围过大，长期无法发布 | 高 | 按 P0/P1/P2 分阶段交付，每阶段单独验收 |\n| 录入复杂导致放弃 | 高 | 每页一个主操作，高级字段折叠，默认模板 |\n| RAG 导入质量不稳定 | 高 | 先完成 Markdown/TXT/HTML 解析链路，再紧随完成 PDF/Word；五种格式均须在首版交付 |\n| 目标进度模型被误解 | 中 | 明确区分“结果进度”和“行动完成” |\n| AI 建议不可靠 | 中 | 带引用、标注不确定性，不做诊断或自动执行 |\n| 数据备份恢复失败 | 高 | v1 早期完成一键备份/恢复测试，并提供导出校验 |',19,208,'{\"charEnd\": 3406, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 3078, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','be4d688a8d63ab24311c3461b068797c8ae48b3cc5b829a11d439dea9ee09dc7','2026-08-21 07:17:59.401'),('1b6dfbe6-ad00-473e-81dc-4cb7b8d9fe4f','9f8623d6-6088-47b9-8fd5-da676edab435','## 7 拟开发平台、开源软件\n\n系统开发和运行使用的软件清单如下。\n\n**类别**\n\n**软件**\n\n**用途**\n\n操作系统\n\nCentOS 7\n\n服务器操作系统\n\nJDK\n\nOpenJDK 8\n\nJava运行环境\n\n关系数据库\n\nMySQL\n\n业务数据存储\n\n缓存\n\nRedis\n\n热点数据缓存\n\n消息队列\n\nKafka\n\n实时数据接入\n\n分布式存储\n\nHadoop HDFS\n\n归档数据存储\n\n资源调度\n\nHadoop YARN\n\n计算资源管理\n\n批处理引擎\n\nSpark\n\n离线数据分析\n\n后端框架\n\nSpring Boot\n\n后端服务开发\n\nORM框架\n\nMyBatis-Plus\n\n数据库操作\n\n前端框架\n\nVue 3\n\n前端页面开发\n\nUI组件\n\nElement Plus\n\n界面组件库\n\n图表\n\nECharts\n\n数据可视化\n\nWeb服务器\n\nNginx\n\n静态资源和反向代理\n\n构建工具\n\nMaven\n\n后端项目构建\n\n构建工具\n\nVite\n\n前端项目构建\n\n版本控制\n\nGit\n\n代码管理\n\n开发环境在本地Windows上搭建，后端使用IntelliJ IDEA开发，本地安装MySQL和Redis用于数据临时存储。前端使用VS Code开发，通过npm run dev启动开发服务器。Hadoop和Spark相关功能在本地开发时可跳过，部署到集群后再进行联调测试。\n\n测试和生产环境部署在4台CentOS虚拟机上。各组件按照第2节的节点分配方案部署。后端服务打包为jar文件，通过java -jar命令启动，使用nohup使其后台运行。前端代码通过npm run build打包后将dist目录内容复制到Nginx的html目录下。',18,433,'{\"charEnd\": 359043, \"docType\": \"docx\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 358315, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"E:\\\\智慧校园.docx\", \"headingPath\": [\"智慧校园大数据系统设计说明书\", \"1  场景描述\", \"2  硬件架构及配置清单\", \"3  基础软件架构及各自作用\", \"4  待开发软件的程序级描述\", \"5  核心数据定义和生命周期管理\", \"6  核心业务流程\", \"7  拟开发平台、开源软件\"], \"documentTitle\": \"智慧校园.docx\"}','32594aa6b21cf3faee02a919f169be02bd4a7be81055d280f52e42afb5da149e','2026-08-21 07:20:57.179'),('1c630b49-aa53-42f8-bc46-aec416974e69','9f8623d6-6088-47b9-8fd5-da676edab435','## 6 核心业务流程\n\n1.  一卡通消费流程\n\n从学生在POS机刷卡后，POS终端读取卡号后向后端发送消费请求并携带一系列请求参数，如学生ID、商户编号、消费金额。后端服务首先查询Redis获取学生余额，Redis未命中时查询MySQL并将结果写入Redis。余额充足时扣减金额，更新MySQL余额字段并删除Redis缓存使其失效。交易记录写入Kafka的consume\\_record主题。Kafka消费者读取消息后将记录插入消费记录表。余额不足时直接返回失败响应，不产生交易记录。',10,178,'{\"charEnd\": 115775, \"docType\": \"docx\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 115531, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"E:\\\\智慧校园.docx\", \"headingPath\": [\"智慧校园大数据系统设计说明书\", \"1  场景描述\", \"2  硬件架构及配置清单\", \"3  基础软件架构及各自作用\", \"4  待开发软件的程序级描述\", \"5  核心数据定义和生命周期管理\", \"6  核心业务流程\", \"7  拟开发平台、开源软件\"], \"documentTitle\": \"智慧校园.docx\"}','f17f0dee381782d6054d1222b7bd66165178eab0870f7b386aa9580111298780','2026-08-21 07:20:57.173'),('20cbc2d8-1ace-41f0-a1fe-e825329aa141','6bacab7c-42f7-4557-8867-c97006b1619d','6.  边界： Agent 绝对不能碰的东西——密钥、第三方库目录、生产环境配置、特定文件夹。“严禁提交密钥”是 GitHub 研究中出现频率最高的有益约束。\n\n明确你的技术栈：说“React 18 配合 TypeScript、Vite 和 Tailwind CSS”，而不是只说“React 项目”。包含版本号和核心依赖。模糊的规范会产生模糊的代码。\n\n使用一致的格式：清晰至上。许多开发者在规范中使用 Markdown 标题甚至类似 XML 的标签来划分章节，因为 AI 模型处理结构化文本的能力优于随意散文。比方说，你可以这样构建规范：\n\n> \\# Project Spec: My team\'s tasks app\n>\n>  ## Objective\n>\n>  \\* Build a web app for small teams to manage tasks...\n>\n>  ## Tech Stack\n>\n>  \\* React 18+, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS\n>\n> \\* Node.js/Express backend, PostgreSQL, Prisma ORM\n>\n>  ## Commands\n>\n>  \\* Build: \\`npm run build\\` (compiles TypeScript, outputs to dist/)\n>\n> \\* Test: \\`npm test\\` (runs Jest, must pass before commits)\n>\n> \\* Lint: \\`npm run lint --fix\\` (auto-fixes ESLint errors)\n>\n>  ## Project Structure\n>\n>  \\* \\`src/\\` – Application source code\n>\n> \\* \\`tests/\\` – Unit and integration tests\n>\n> \\* \\`docs/\\` – Documentation\n>\n>  ## Boundaries\n>\n>  \\* ✅ Always: Run tests before commits, follow naming conventions\n>\n> \\* ⚠️ Ask first: Database schema changes, adding dependencies\n>\n> \\* 🚫 Never: Commit secrets, edit node\\_modules/, modify CI config\n\n组织到这种程度不仅能帮你理清思路，还能帮 AI 快速定位信息。Anthropic 的工程师建议将提示词组织成不同的章节（如 \\`<background>\\`、\\`<instructions>\\`、\\`<tools>\\`、\\`<output\\_format>\\` 等），原因就在于：它能为模型提供强有力的线索，区分哪些信息是什么。请记住，“简约不代表简短”——如果某些细节很重要，不要害怕在规范中写得太细，只需保持聚焦即可。',7,532,'{\"charEnd\": 4589, \"docType\": \"webpage\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 3272, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\", \"sourcePath\": null, \"headingPath\": [\"拆解GitHub 2500个案例后：我们总结出编写AI Agent规范的“六大军规”\", \"1. 从顶层愿景开始，让 AI 拟定细节\", \"2. 像写专业的 PRD（或 SRS）一样构建规范\", \"3. 将任务拆解为模块化的提示词和上下文，而非单一庞大的提示词\", \"单 Agent vs 多 Agent：何时该用哪种\", \"4. 内置自检、约束和人类的专业经验\", \"5. 测试、迭代并演进规范（并使用正确的工具）\", \"避免常见坑点\", \"结语\"], \"documentTitle\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\"}','00db86c996c0a35c663bd5275ce827bcdf4bdb4e032cb659f74a55d1ac905559','2026-08-21 07:19:36.949'),('21b35eba-86dc-492c-8c01-505f2851874a','a974976b-7a08-4584-b427-02301a9ffcd2','### P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\n\n| 功能 | 范围 |\n|---|---|\n| 目标管理 | 三种目标类型、数据点、里程碑、状态流转 |\n| 生活项目 | CRUD、起止时间、可选关联目标 |\n| 待办 | CRUD、截止时间、完成、按目标/项目筛选 |\n| 目标行动区 | 查看目标下关联待办和项目 |\n| 习惯 | 创建、每日打卡、连续天数、历史记录；与待办并列作为执行层核心功能 |\n| Dashboard | 主区为今日行动（待办 + 习惯打卡）；次区为目标进展摘要、近期目标和到期提醒 |\n| 周期提醒 | 目标到期、习惯打卡、数据录入，站内可配置 |\n| 数据安全 | MySQL + Milvus 一键备份，JSON/Markdown 导出 |\n| 基础搜索 | 标题、正文、标签、类型检索 |',10,228,'{\"charEnd\": 1877, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 1521, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','213874ba8226b43255b1713faa494e80416928a8fea518009454a9fb8bb5edc2','2026-08-21 07:17:59.392'),('21c40f18-f353-4d7e-bb73-246ec73531fa','6bacab7c-42f7-4557-8867-c97006b1619d','一份 AI Agent 规范绝非“一劳永逸”。它是指令、验证和精炼这一持续循环的一部分。这种勤勉的回报是丰厚的：通过及早发现问题并保持 Agent 的步调一致，可以避免后期昂贵的重写或失败。正如一位 AI 工程师打趣道，运用这些实践感觉就像拥有一支“实习生大军”为你效力，但你必须管理好他们。一份持续维护的优秀规范，就是你的管理工具。',28,140,'{\"charEnd\": 16947, \"docType\": \"webpage\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 16780, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\", \"sourcePath\": null, \"headingPath\": [\"拆解GitHub 2500个案例后：我们总结出编写AI Agent规范的“六大军规”\", \"1. 从顶层愿景开始，让 AI 拟定细节\", \"2. 像写专业的 PRD（或 SRS）一样构建规范\", \"3. 将任务拆解为模块化的提示词和上下文，而非单一庞大的提示词\", \"单 Agent vs 多 Agent：何时该用哪种\", \"4. 内置自检、约束和人类的专业经验\", \"5. 测试、迭代并演进规范（并使用正确的工具）\", \"避免常见坑点\", \"结语\"], \"documentTitle\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\"}','742a445984b5c9d66ea816b1d7de3cc97f433d1924812fd8b48fb90927c601ee','2026-08-21 07:19:36.960'),('221324ab-c659-42a1-b404-b5f49fa01b9c','6bacab7c-42f7-4557-8867-c97006b1619d','保持目标导向：AI Agent 的概要规范应更多地关注“做什么”和“为什么”，而不是纠结于“怎么做”的琐碎细节（至少在初期如此）。可以把它想象成用户故事和验收标准：用户是谁？他们需要什么？成功的标准是什么？（比方说：“用户可以添加、编辑、完成任务；数据持久化保存；应用响应迅速且安全”）。这能让 AI 生成的详细规范立足于用户需求和结果，而不仅仅是技术待办事项。正如 GitHub Spec Kit 文档所言，提供关于构建内容及其原因的概要描述，让编程 Agent 生成专注于用户体验和成功标准的详细规范。从大局愿景出发，可以防止 Agent 在随后进入编码阶段时“只见树木不见森林”。',5,235,'{\"charEnd\": 2658, \"docType\": \"webpage\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 2365, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\", \"sourcePath\": null, \"headingPath\": [\"拆解GitHub 2500个案例后：我们总结出编写AI Agent规范的“六大军规”\", \"1. 从顶层愿景开始，让 AI 拟定细节\", \"2. 像写专业的 PRD（或 SRS）一样构建规范\", \"3. 将任务拆解为模块化的提示词和上下文，而非单一庞大的提示词\", \"单 Agent vs 多 Agent：何时该用哪种\", \"4. 内置自检、约束和人类的专业经验\", \"5. 测试、迭代并演进规范（并使用正确的工具）\", \"避免常见坑点\", \"结语\"], \"documentTitle\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\"}','7bf8079aa485c8cf390ad531e320df0e2e1237ab96edb5807cee251005947fa1','2026-08-21 07:19:36.948'),('224b755b-c83c-4912-8d52-8fc744465f86','6bacab7c-42f7-4557-8867-c97006b1619d','带入你的领域知识：你的规范应体现出只有经验丰富的开发者或知情者才具备的见解。比方说，如果你在构建一个电商 Agent，且深知“产品”和“类别”之间是多对多关系，请明确指出（不要假设 AI 会推断出来——它可能推断不出）。如果某个库是出了名的难搞，请提到要避免的坑。本质上，这相当于把你的“导师经验”灌注进规范里。规范可以包含类似这样的建议：“如果使用库 X，注意版本 Y 中的内存泄漏问题（请应用变通方案 Z）”。这种层级的细节能将平庸的 AI 输出转化为真正健壮的方案，因为你已经引导 AI 避开了常见陷阱。\n\n此外，如果你有个人偏好或风格指南（比方说，“在 React 中优先使用函数组件而非类组件”），请将其写入规范。AI 随后会模仿你的风格。许多工程师甚至在规范中包含简短的示例，比方说：“所有 API 响应都应为 JSON。比方说：错误时返回 \\`{\"error\": \"message\"}\\`”。通过提供一个简单的示例，你可以将 AI 固定在你想要的准确格式上。\n\n针对简单任务保持极简：虽然我们提倡规范要详尽，但专业水平的体现之一在于知道何时该保持简单。对于相对简单、孤立的任务，规范过度详尽反而可能帮倒忙，让人困惑。如果你要求 Agent 做一些简单的事情（如“将页面上的 div 居中”），你可能只需说：“确保方案简洁，不要添加多余的标记或样式”。这种时候不需要完整的 PRD。相反，对于复杂的任务（如“实现带 token 刷新和错误处理的 OAuth 流程”），那才是拿出详细规范的时候。一条金科玉律是：根据任务复杂度调整规范细节。对于难题不要规范不足（Agent 会乱阵脚或偏离轨道），对琐碎任务也不要规范过度（Agent 可能会陷入细枝末节或在不必要的指令上耗尽上下文）。',21,597,'{\"charEnd\": 13239, \"docType\": \"webpage\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 12492, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\", \"sourcePath\": null, \"headingPath\": [\"拆解GitHub 2500个案例后：我们总结出编写AI Agent规范的“六大军规”\", \"1. 从顶层愿景开始，让 AI 拟定细节\", \"2. 像写专业的 PRD（或 SRS）一样构建规范\", \"3. 将任务拆解为模块化的提示词和上下文，而非单一庞大的提示词\", \"单 Agent vs 多 Agent：何时该用哪种\", \"4. 内置自检、约束和人类的专业经验\", \"5. 测试、迭代并演进规范（并使用正确的工具）\", \"避免常见坑点\", \"结语\"], \"documentTitle\": \"https://eu.36kr.com/zh/p/3713736075636867\"}','c11412bc245596f3c5a1a72d9a2297fe4a9fdbe520e87618cdbb0f95ec2e1848','2026-08-21 07:19:36.957'),('246607ca-a571-4f3f-8d96-1a0de004cc8b','212387c6-05f7-4c19-a401-8de1d2550973','如果   mysql   命令不可用，可以使用完整路径： 本项目默认连接   localhost:3306 。如果   3306   被占用，优先停止占用该端口的其他   MySQL   服务；若必须 换端口，需要同步修改   application.properties 。  四、在   IDEA   中下载和配置   JDK 17  即使电脑没有单独安装   JDK ，也可以直接使用   IDEA   下载：  1.   选择   File -> Project Structure 。  2.   左侧选择   SDKs ，点击   + ，选择   Download JDK... 。  3. Version   选择   17 。  4. Vendor   可选择   Eclipse Temurin   等稳定发行版。  5.   安装目录建议使用不含中文和空格的路径，例如   C:\\Java\\jdk-17 。  6.   点击   Download ，等待下载完成。  7.   在   Project Structure -> Project   中将   SDK   设置为   JDK 17 。  8.   将   Language level   设置为   Java 17 。  9.   点击   Apply ，再点击   OK 。 如果没有   Download JDK... ，可手动安装   JDK 17 ，然后在   Project Structure -> SDKs -> + -> Add JDK   中 选择安装目录。  五、导入项目并配置   Maven  5.1   导入项目  1.   打开   IntelliJ IDEA 。  2.   选择   File -> Open 。  3.   选择项目根目录，例如：  4.   点击   Open 。  5.   如果   IDEA   询问是否信任项目，选择   Trust Project 。  6.   等待   IDEA   识别   pom.xml   并解析依赖。 如果没有自动导入   Maven ：  1.   打开右侧   Maven   工具窗口。  2.   点击   + 。  3.   选择项目根目录下的   pom.xml 。  4.   点击   Reload All Maven Projects 。  SELECT   VERSION(); SHOW   DATABASES; exit; &   \"C:\\Program   Files\\MySQL\\MySQL   Server   8.0\\bin\\mysql.exe\"   -u   root   -p D:\\javaweb\\[ 数据库设计 ] 小型网上书店系统',2,484,'{\"charEnd\": 3060, \"docType\": \"pdf\", \"pageEnd\": 3, \"charStart\": 1885, \"pageStart\": 3, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\[数据库设计]小型网上书店系统\\\\部署教程.pdf\", \"headingPath\": [], \"documentTitle\": \"部署教程.pdf\"}','bdae8cd8349f08fd5c99df2223b37cdf6f971a1e52bcdc384e19daba5c2a8dbe','2026-08-21 07:20:16.425'),('246d5313-e15f-43f3-8522-9dea4bee0e87','595cccd5-b821-406a-8741-303737d020e4','20 of 30  Standardized Benchmarks and Reproducibility Existing work differs widely in agent backbone, task set, budget, and compressed target, which makes direct comparison difficult. Future benchmarks should report not only task success and token savings, but also information density, recoverability, error propagation, and controller overhead under controlled settings. Concluding Discussion Agent context compression is no longer just a preprocessing convenience. For long-horizon agents, it is a state-management problem over a changing workspace, not a one-shot prompt-shortening step. This survey structures the area along three axes: targets, mechanisms, and control policies. It also introduces a failure taxonomy and an evaluation framework that goes beyond task success. The key challenge is not only stronger compression, but compression that remains recoverable, faithful, and aligned with long-term agent execution.  Preprints.org   (www.preprints.org) | NOT PEER-REVIEWED | Posted: 29 May 2026   doi:10.20944/preprints202605.2065.v1  © 2026 by the author(s). Distributed under a Creative Commons CC BY license.',20,282,'{\"charEnd\": 74586, \"docType\": \"pdf\", \"pageEnd\": 21, \"charStart\": 73461, \"pageStart\": 21, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\我\\\\论文\\\\Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\", \"headingPath\": [], \"documentTitle\": \"Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\"}','79b00c7b47ed370d5b80c6146006e1a87e9bbd9fba23447f7bf010c3fd214722','2026-08-21 07:20:47.272'),('25a40d77-963c-4ec7-b1c7-c2845e04fbb3','bf3a9adf-2c5e-47c4-82a0-160f5337c5f0','### 情绪觉察\n\n`记录情绪 → 查看分布与趋势 → 生成周报 → 阅读建议`\n\nAI 只提供候选分析和建议，不自动修改用户数据。',17,48,'{\"charEnd\": 2707, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 2641, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','28098fafb1d08c901b2bdf3a0a96556896d195a946fab91118402bd5a58ccd7e','2026-08-21 07:14:21.081'),('25e660f7-5858-4e6a-9ea3-db8d5dfc9d21','595cccd5-b821-406a-8741-303737d020e4','4 of 30  Property 1: Dynamic Growth.   Context is not provided all at once but expands incrementally by absorbing new interactions   x t   with each agent step. Unlike static documents with fully exposed structures, agentic compression operates blindly on this continuous stream, dynamically distilling history without foreseeing future states.  Property 2: Heterogeneous Composition.   Context comprises highly distinct structured content, including natural language plans, code snippets, JSON tool outputs, screenshots, and error logs. While natural language thoughts ( t t ) may endure lossy abstraction, actions and observations often demand strict syntactic fidelity, mandating type-aware rather than uniform compression.  Property 3: Multi-step Dependency.   Information compressed or discarded at a certain step may only be needed several steps later. Driven by continuous streaming, the utility of any specific tuple compo- nent   e   manifests over future steps:   U   ( e ) =   E  h  ∑ T  τ = t   γ τ − t   ·   u τ   ( e )  i  . Consequently, it is inherently difficult to predict future demands during compression, as the true importance of   e   remains unobservable at time   t .  Property 4: Error Propagation.   Errors or omissions introduced by compression are not discov- ered locally.   Instead, a state distortion   δ t   =   d ( C t , ˜ C t )   propagates backward along the trajectory:  C t + k   =   U ( k ) (   ˜ C t ,   x t + 1: t + k ) . These errors accumulate irreversibly and are treated as factual grounding by subsequent reasoning steps, permanently shifting the action space and derailing the agent from the optimal path.  ▶   Why Traditional Compression Fails   ◀   Traditional methods satisfy one-off budget constraints by optimizing for immediate relevance [24,36]. For example, KV cache compression typically evicts tokens with low current attention scores [14,37]. However, under the four properties above, applying such static interventions to an evolving agentic loop triggers compounding distortions, as continuous interaction defies any static definition of information importance.  2.2. A Unified Operational Pipeline for Agent Context Compression  We formulate a unified four-stage pipeline that decomposes compression into an operator system over the context lifecycle:  C t + 1   =   R ( q t + 1 ,   M t )  |   {z   }  Recover  ⊕   M    Φ  S ( C t )   |   {z   }  Store ← Compress ← Select  ⊕   x t + 1   (1) •   Select ( S ):   A critical triage phase where the system determines which subsets of the context require compression and which demand exact preservation. •   Compress ( Φ ):   Specific reductive or structural transformations, ranging from simple truncation to latent encoding, are executed on the selected subset. •   Store ( M ):   The resulting compressed representations are committed either to the active working memory or offloaded to an external storage state   M t . •   Recover ( R ):   Driven by the necessity of deferred utility, relevant compressed information is selectively retrieved and decoded from   M t   using the current query   q t + 1 .  3. Compression as Sufficient State Approximation  We argue that agent context compression is best understood as a sufficient-state approximation problem: the goal is to maintain the shortest representation that remains sufficient for future action. Compression as State Transformation. Let   C t   denote the current context state. We treat each compression method as a transformation  O i   :   C → C ,   C ′  t   =   O i ( C t ) , where   O i   maps   C t   to a shorter, reorganized, or externally mediated representation   C ′  t   under task- specific constraints. This abstraction is deliberately broad. It covers the operator families discussed later  Preprints.org   (www.preprints.org) | NOT PEER-REVIEWED | Posted: 29 May 2026   doi:10.20944/preprints202605.2065.v1  © 2026 by the author(s). Distributed under a Creative Commons CC BY license.',4,993,'{\"charEnd\": 16191, \"docType\": \"pdf\", \"pageEnd\": 5, \"charStart\": 12222, \"pageStart\": 5, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\我\\\\论文\\\\Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\", \"headingPath\": [], \"documentTitle\": \"Context Compression for LLM Agents.pdf\"}','f618dd9427ff2ed1924698ab2c91ba9b1ade2db6366181e981b1f86c15b0e2c0','2026-08-21 07:20:47.261'),('275b6abc-efea-4bd1-92b1-c6ae6f1a848c','a974976b-7a08-4584-b427-02301a9ffcd2','### 回顾线：发生过什么\n\n- 时间线记录：日记、灵感、决策记录、阅读记录（周复盘独立走固定三问流程）。\n- 记录可通过 `entity_link` 关联目标、项目、待办、知识文档和开发项目。\n- 记录可一键升格为知识库文档。',7,83,'{\"charEnd\": 1401, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 1287, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','0e2629af842fb461b0b1ae77ba608babd367e43ca252f48152a6f4b8f2864e8a','2026-08-21 07:17:59.388'),('2a472161-90fc-4531-9489-a4160bbbf203','212387c6-05f7-4c19-a401-8de1d2550973','2.2   检查项目文件  确认项目根目录包含：  三、安装   MySQL 8.0  3.1   使用   MySQL Installer   安装  官方下载地址：  https://dev.mysql.com/downloads/installer/  安装步骤：  1.   下载并打开   MySQL Installer for Windows 。  2.   选择   Developer Default   或   Server only 。只运行本项目时选择   Server only   即可。  3.   服务器类型选择   Development Computer 。  4.   端口使用默认的   3306 。  5.   身份验证方式使用   MySQL 8   默认推荐方式。  6.   设置   root   密码。若设置为   123456 ，可直接使用项目默认配置；若设置其他密码，需在   IDEA   启动 配置中填写。  7.   将   MySQL   配置为   Windows   服务，服务名通常为   MySQL80 ，并设置为自动启动。  8.   完成安装。  3.2   检查和启动   MySQL   服务  按   Win + R ，输入   services.msc ，在服务列表中找到   MySQL80 。 状态为正在运行时无需操作。 未运行时右键选择启动。 建议将启动类型设置为自动。 也可以使用管理员   PowerShell ： 如果服务名称不是   MySQL80 ，请以服务管理器中显示的实际名称为准。  3.3   验证   MySQL   登录  登录成功后执行：  pom.xml database-design.sql src\\main\\java\\cn\\bookstore\\BookstoreApplication.java src\\main\\resources\\application.properties Get-Service   MySQL80 Start-Service   MySQL80 mysql   -u   root   -p',1,405,'{\"charEnd\": 1883, \"docType\": \"pdf\", \"pageEnd\": 2, \"charStart\": 965, \"pageStart\": 2, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\[数据库设计]小型网上书店系统\\\\部署教程.pdf\", \"headingPath\": [], \"documentTitle\": \"部署教程.pdf\"}','e9b3f800936e469168f8d9ef2138b16b95d13b38a04af43f01479e3ce2eb0a06','2026-08-21 07:20:16.424'),('2a4e85a6-7108-48fc-973e-5ba920c9a68d','bf3a9adf-2c5e-47c4-82a0-160f5337c5f0','### 行动线：准备做什么\n\n- **项目**：有明确起止时间和成果的行动容器，可挂目标，也可独立存在。\n- **待办**：单次行动，最多关联一个目标和一个生活项目。\n- **习惯**：独立实体，拥有打卡历史和连续天数，不与待办合并。',6,89,'{\"charEnd\": 1285, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 1168, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','5f6ba7e80b4fe1b523c7c8360066b167918fd59dfc9a00badc8d5a11128426f9','2026-08-21 07:14:21.053'),('2a8faf18-8cda-4867-b27b-5a5823916dfd','bf3a9adf-2c5e-47c4-82a0-160f5337c5f0','### 知识沉淀\n\n`收藏链接或导入文件 → 收藏箱处理 → 剪藏入库 → 分块与向量化 → 搜索/RAG 问答 → 引用原文`',15,43,'{\"charEnd\": 2579, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 2515, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','3c297e3a537ee56dba611c214eebcafe8fba8508395f907fb5b13eae493c2964','2026-08-21 07:14:21.075'),('2c37dc9a-0cad-406d-9b67-cbebc67596e5','bf3a9adf-2c5e-47c4-82a0-160f5337c5f0','## 2. Goals & Success Metrics\n\n| 目标 | 指标 | 初始基线 | v1 目标 |\n|---|---|---:|---:|\n| 保持持续使用 | 每周完成核心动作的天数 | TBD | ≥ 4 天 |\n| 降低计划失焦 | 每周至少一次目标/待办回顾比例 | TBD | ≥ 60% |\n| 提升行动完成 | 待办完成率 | TBD | 较基线提升 20% |\n| 提升目标可见性 | 有实际数据或里程碑更新的目标比例 | TBD | ≥ 70% |\n| 提升知识可用性 | 用户通过搜索/RAG 找到目标内容的成功率 | TBD | ≥ 70% |\n| 支持自我觉察 | 情绪记录后的自评帮助度 | TBD | ≥ 3.5/5 |\n| 降低焦虑 | 负面情绪强度中位数趋势（自评，非因果） | TBD | 呈下降趋势 |\n\n不追求打开次数、使用时长、完成数量排名或游戏化。',2,231,'{\"charEnd\": 835, \"docType\": \"markdown\", \"pageEnd\": null, \"charStart\": 432, \"pageStart\": null, \"sourceUrl\": null, \"sourcePath\": \"D:\\\\javaweb\\\\个人博客\\\\人生系统\\\\PRD&功能优先级.md\", \"headingPath\": [\"PRD: 人生系统 v1\", \"1. Problem Statement\", \"2. Goals & Success Metrics\", \"3. Non-Goals\", \"4. Core Model\", \"目标线：想达成什么\", \"行动线：准备做什么\", \"回顾线：发生过什么\", \"知识线：长期可复用什么\", \"5. Functional Scope & Priority\", \"P0：必须跑通的核心闭环\", \"P1：形成“回顾与知识”价值\", \"P2：v1 后半段交付（范围保留，工程顺序靠后）\", \"6. 关键用户流程\", \"目标推进\", \"知识沉淀\", \"个人回顾\", \"情绪觉察\", \"7. 技术与依赖\", \"8. 主要风险\", \"9. 发布建议\", \"10. 已确认的产品决策\"], \"documentTitle\": \"PRD&功能优先级.md\"}','ce5438633c1107b239f3c8782128c39f525bc3d0f22dede90ad7974aad55d2c7','2026-08-21 07:14:21.049'),('2e8c15e3-f7dd-4060-b71f-ab0c0680afd5','595cccd5-b821-406a-8741-303737d0